WEBVTT

00:12:29.828 --> 00:12:31.705
I have learned that the people

00:12:31.747 --> 00:12:35.209
who are keeping lions
roaming in Kenya today

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:39.296
are warriors and women
and children and elders.

00:12:39.338 --> 00:12:42.007
They are people educated by their culture;

00:12:42.049 --> 00:12:45.344
they are urbanites with a respect
for that culture.

00:12:45.844 --> 00:12:51.058
And as more Africans allow co-existence
to happen in our spaces,

00:12:51.099 --> 00:12:54.728
we will turn back the clock
on wildlife declines

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:57.648
and really make life better for all of us.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.819
It is time for conservation to be broad.